~ start
Nathan: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
Nathan: Here are some choices.
- First one
	Nathan: You picked the first one.
- Second one
	Nathan: You picked the second one.
- Alternate Path => fight_success
#	%
#		naf
#		=> fight_failure
- End the conversation => END
Nathan: For more information see the online documentation.
=> END

~ fight_success
	#do Game.player.apply_stat(Character.StatType.HEALTH, -10.0)
	#do Game.player.apply_stat(Character.StatType.HUNGER, -5.0)
You sucessfully defeat them albeit not without injury.
=> END

~ fight_failure
	#do Game.player.apply_stat(Character.StatType.HUNGER, -5.0)
You sucessfully defeat them without injury.
=> END

~ alternate_path
hello there
- Start again => start
- End => END